{"id":"d4433b162551de1f","group":"88","path":"88/88-thm-pr-total.md","title":"Primitive Recursive Functions are Total","display":"thm-pr-total — Primitive Recursive Functions are Total","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-thm-pr-total","aliases":["88-thm-pr-total"],"display":"thm-pr-total — Primitive Recursive Functions are Total","depends_on":["[[88-df-primitive-recursive]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-thm-pr-total"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-thm-pr-total</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pr-total — Primitive Recursive Functions are Total"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2f808bc294509a7d\" href=\"?note=2f808bc294509a7d\" title=\"88-df-primitive-recursive\">88-df-primitive-recursive</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> (arity)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> (candidate number-theoretic function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k(f)\\)</span> (arity-indexed primitive-recursive predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pr\\text{-}total} \\vdash\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall f\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k(f)\n\\to\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\mathbb N^k\n\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\\exists!y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n(f(\\vec x)=y)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pr\\text{-}total} \\vdash\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall f\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k(f)\n\\to\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\mathbb N^k\n\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\\exists!y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n(f(\\vec x)=y)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>唯一存在同时表达全定义与函数值唯一性。</li>\n<li>所有原始递归函数都是全函数</li>\n<li>这是原始递归函数的关键性质</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"2f808bc294509a7d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-primitive-recursive]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pr\\text{-}total} \\vdash\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall f\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k(f)\n\\to\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\mathbb N^k\n\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\\exists!y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n(f(\\vec x)=y)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":893,"backlinks":[{"id":"27b8db839bec5892","anchor":"ref-177","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[88-thm-ackermann-not-pr.md]]\n[[88-thm-arithmetical-hierarchy-strict.md]]\n[[88-thm-compactness.md]]\n[[88-thm-completeness.md]]\n[[88-thm-first-incompleteness.md]]\n[[88-thm-friedberg-muchnik.md]]\n[[88-thm-halting-problem.md]]\n[[88-thm-halting-undecidable.md]]\n[[88-thm-jump-strict-def.md]]\n[[88-thm-jump-strict.md]]\n[[88-thm-kleene-normal-form.md]]\n[[88-thm-kleene-recursion.md]]\n[[88-thm-lob.md]]\n[[88-thm-lowenheim-skolem.md]]\n[[88-thm-ls-upward.md]]\n[[88-thm-partial-tm-equivalence.md]]\n[[88-thm-post-problem-solved.md]]\n[[88-thm-post-theorem.md]]\n[[88-thm-pr-total.md]]\n[[88-thm-rice-